 A negative scientific result alone does not authorize implementation repair or
 a workflow jump.
 
+### Explicit B01 evaluator qualification
+
+B01 normally remains source work. An owner may explicitly opt into bounded native
+evaluator/baseline qualification without changing the adopted catalog or its
+historical hashes. Pin this JSON under the project root:
+
+```json
+{
+  "kind": "research-b01-qualification-authorization",
+  "schema_version": 1,
+  "project_id": "field-study",
+  "goal_id": "original-goal",
+  "step_id": "B01",
+  "native_purpose": "qualification",
+  "instruction_ref": {"path": "research-state/user-qualification.md", "sha256": "ACTUAL_HASH"},
+  "native_target_ref": {"path": "research-state/native-target.json", "sha256": "ACTUAL_HASH"},
+  "max_tasks": 1,
+  "max_task_seconds": 3600
+}
+```
+
+`instruction_ref` retains the actual user direction. The target must equal the
+program's already adopted `native_target_ref`. `max_tasks` bounds each proposal
+(1–64); it adds no lifetime task cap. `max_task_seconds` must fit the existing
+project time limits. Existing budgets, serial execution and pause rules continue
+to apply. The JSON example needs real project values and hashes before use.
+
+For a new schema-2 program, add its pin as
+`sequence.qualification_authorization_ref`. For an existing program, stop its
+consumer at an active B01 `decide` boundary, reconcile all work, then invoke the
+supervising-host API:
+
+```python
+program.authorize_b01_qualification(
+    project_id, authorization_ref, expected_revision=observed_revision)
+```
+
+This one-time amendment rejects paused/blocked programs, another step, staged or
+pending work, running/uncertain attempts, stale revisions and replacement of an
+existing opt-in. It atomically retains an immutable receipt containing the old
+contract/state and the adopted contract, increments revision, and appends the
+`b01_qualification_authorized` event. The state gains only
+`qualification_adoption_ref`; catalog, cursor, prior receipts, decisions, coverage,
+tasks and consumed budgets are preserved. Source or target adoption is separate.
+
+Worker and reviewer packets expose `qualification_authorization` and retain its
+pins. The worker can prepare the actual qualification protocol/plans and request
+`native_harness` with `native_purpose=qualification`, `research_scope=diagnostic`,
+and `qualification_authorization_ref` matching the opt-in. Existing canonical v4
+admission rejects treatment jobs and still requires the fixed target, coverage,
+finite reservation and separate review before execution. This extension does not
+enable method implementation/design actions or advance B01. Actual receipts and
+normal independent per-requirement acceptance remain necessary.
+
 Use the exact response schema supplied in each handoff. A successful command or
 DSH activation merely transports the response. A file hash establishes identity,
 not scientific truth. The program checks real evidence and required bindings;
